    "title": "Describe routines and frequency",
    "subtitle": "Learn, understand, and use a Mandarin pattern.",
    "context": "Use the introduced pattern in a bounded sentence. Other wording may be valid Chinese; this task checks this pattern and these words.",
    "steps": [
      {
        "id": "EX-GRAM-G-habits-teach",
        "kind": "teach",
        "title": "Describe routines and frequency",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "text": "Put 常常, 经常 or 常 before an action for frequent occasions. 有时候 and 有时 mean sometimes; 总是 presents a consistently repeated pattern. 从来不 states an absent habit. These describe recurrence, not one action continuing without stopping.",
            "examples": [
              {
                "text": "我常常七点起床。",
                "pinyin": "wǒ chángcháng qī diǎn qǐchuáng 。",
                "meaning": "I often get up at seven.",
                "audio": "64d719c076f8b9d64d4d67ee46d9744dd075c313f2c41f1b1428b4f148679fce"
              },
              {
                "text": "我有时候在家吃饭。",
                "pinyin": "wǒ yǒushíhou zài jiā chī fàn 。",
                "meaning": "I sometimes eat at home.",
                "audio": "fab697c0e3df5660b98b28f96349bce0ad8aade4d0b4a07008c72b62d3eb0e38"
              },
              {
                "text": "他总是很早来。",
                "pinyin": "tā zǒngshì hěn zǎo lái 。",
                "meaning": "He always comes early.",
                "audio": "93d86a8ac8fd1529c93de926d2d3a8ea03659ce4c1b1e4f64dd8c8a4bc156a5a"
              },
              {
                "text": "我从来不喝茶。",
                "pinyin": "wǒ cónglái bù hē chá 。",
                "meaning": "I never drink tea.",
                "audio": "d1a25a258f87750cfb6e0593c5a6197d242169cdd8e9693f722e3eddc44dc475"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
